      "title": "Automatic level download consumes an unbounded response",
      "category": "resource_exhaustion",
      "cwe": "CWE-400",
      "file": "Users/eliahilse/Documents/GitHub/B/apogames/Android/ApoClock/src/net/apogames/apoclock/editor/ApoClockUserlevelsLoad.java",
      "line": 182,
      "code_excerpt": "\t\t\t\t\twhile (null != ((str = input.readLine()))) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif (i % 11 == 0) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthis.levels.add(str);",
